  "display_title": "This is What First Love Is Like, Your Majesty",
  "description": "Once cursed to never love, Crown Prince Kalart stuns the royal ball by declaring his love… for a hefty black cat that looks more suited to a back alley than a palace. Determined to win the cat’s affection, he brings its seemingly ordinary owner, Roserikta, into the royal palace. But appearances can be deceiving—Roserikta is clearly hiding something… something magical. Thus begins a whimsical romance between a cursed prince, a mysterious woman, and one unforgettable feline.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
